- Per-task port env vars merged from `WorkspacePortsRuntime.getEnvForWorktree(cwd)` (lines 320-324).
- `CLAUDE_CODE_NO_FLICKER=1` always set to disable Claude Code's own viewport scrolling (line 327) — Dash manages the terminal viewport itself.
- `DASH_HOOK_PORT` set last (wins over inherited value) when `hookServer.port !== 0`, so hook curl commands in `settings.local.json` (written by `writeHookSettings`, from `./ptyHookSettings`) route back to the app's local HookServer (lines 329-337).

